Hi Tom, I see the request in my approval queue. Before I approve, one questio=
n: you only mention Rotterdam, but in the team plan you also take over part o=
f the Venlo outbound runs. If so, the shipping point authorization for Venlo =
(VN01) has to be in the request too, otherwise VT01N will refuse you with 'no=
 authorization for shipping point' on Venlo deliveries.

VT01N/VT02N come with the role Z_LE_SHIPMENT_PLANNER and VL06O with Z_LE_DELI=
VERY_MONITOR. Both are fine for your function, so no extra sign-off is needed=
. Can you confirm the plants?

